{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a Simple 3D Platformer .Player is a Stick man .Every time Player jumps,stick man swarp Color.If Player Stepped on the Block that is the same Color as the Player,He get hurts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Over 20+ levels to Challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Player needs to Go to Exit Sign to Finish the level.and Collect some stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Grounds and walls are made of Color Blocks.Enemies also has it's own Color.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Player should not Touch the same color Block.Otherwise he will be Knocked back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Every time player jumps,Player change Color.so Jump wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-WASD to move ,Space to jump.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Enjoy!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3659960?t=1744758111","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659960/c77e60e3693e4106a5fce3e13caf5146d600c0e2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744758111","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659960/78fe9d3ccd572061151df7b6b32b4794044d4adf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744758111","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659960/78fe9d3ccd572061151df7b6b32b4794044d4adf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744758111","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a Simple 3D Platformer .Player is a Stick man .Every time Player jumps,stick man swarp Color.If Player Stepped on the Block that is the same Color as the Player,He get hurts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Over 20+ levels to Challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Player needs to Go to Exit Sign to Finish the level.and